ic butterscotch cake but as a pastry. The base is a vanilla sponge cake topped with caramel cream, candied butterscotch nuts, and a drizzle of caramel sauce. This is a classic butterscotch recipe."}}},{"card":{"info":{"id":"87662865","name":"Black Forest Pastry","price":10900,"imageId":"FOOD_CATALOG/IMAGES/CMS/2026/9/2/ae73be43-0ccc-464f-92dc-a3dd26b338da_949f0113-edad-4ab4-9e92-78304b23f6a4.jpg","description":"Serves 1 | This eggless pastry layers moist chocolate sponge with creamy chocolate and vanilla whipped cream, finished with dark cherry compote. Topped with chocolate shavings and a cherry, it’s a delightful treat for your sweet cravings."}}},{"card":{"info":{"id":"87662999","name":"Blueberry Baked Cheesecake Slice","price":21900,"imageId":"f532ecd6ffae5ca5b75cf0f18c1123ac","description":"Serves 1 | A light and creamy cheesecake slice made with cream cheese and topped with blueberry compote."}}},{"card":{"info":{"id":"87663009","name":"Set of 2 Birthday Poster Chocolate Jar Cakes","defaultPrice":32900,"imageId":"hi7hqkd2k5pi1q0lvcu5","description":"Serves 2 | 2 chocolate jar cakes topped with sugar sheets with special birthday graphics"}}},{"card":{"info":{"id":"87663010","name":"Set of 2 Anniversary Poster Chocolate Jar Cakes","defaultPrice":32900,"imageId":"calc3omdyyick4zzh6wr","description":"Serves 2 | A set of 2 chocolate jar cakes topped with anniversary wishes"}}}]}}},{"card":{"card":{"@type":"type.googleapis.com/swiggy.presentation.food.v2.ItemCategory","title":"Mini Combos","itemCards":[{"card":{"info":{"id":"87662986","name":"Chocolate Mud & Blueberry Mini Jar Cake Combo","price":28900,"imageId":"ns36gmsxtbkpxej1qj8a","description":"Serves 2 | A combo of 2 mini jar cakes. Chocolate Mud & Blueberry"}}},{"card":{"info":{"id":"151287070","name":"Biscoff & Blueberry Cheesecake Combo","price":42900,"imageId":"FOOD_CATALOG/IMAGES/CMS/2026/1/24/5d84baeb-f053-4abe-a62a-92adb0866c7f_07415af6-fc54-47b9-8a82-77d4ccd56e75.jpg","description":"Serves 2 | Enjoy th